// One-parameter ansatz with a toy two-qubit Hamiltonian. The coefficients are
// illustrative, not a chemistry result.
//
//   quell draw    vqe_ansatz.quell
//   quell observe vqe_ansatz.quell --param theta=0.7
//   quell gradient vqe_ansatz.quell --param theta=0.7
//   quell vqe     vqe_ansatz.quell
//
// All four run on the local statevector with exact expectation. No provider
// is contacted.

PARAM theta : angle
observable h = -1.05 * Z(0) + 0.39 * Z(1) + 0.18 * X(0) * X(1)

X 0
RY theta 1
CNOT 1 0
MEASURE
